            "血液生化学 (Blood Chemistry) - elevated lactate (>2.5 mmol/L = severe), hypoalbuminemia, hyperbilirubinemia, hypoglycemia (cat-specific), elevated creatinine",
            "凝固検査 (Coagulation Panel) - DIC screening: prolonged PT/aPTT, low fibrinogen",
            "血液ガス (Arterial Blood Gas) - hypoxemia (lung is shock organ in cats), metabolic acidosis",
